Custom Suricata Rules Developed During the Project
Rule No.	Rule Name,	Suricata, Rule	,Purpose
*	ICMP Ping Detection,	alert icmp any any -> any any (msg:"ICMP Ping Detected"; sid:1000001; rev:1;) ,	Detects ICMP echo requests (ping) between hosts.
*	HTTP Traffic Detection,	alert tcp any any -> any 80 (msg:"HTTP Traffic Detected"; sid:1000002; rev:1;) ,	Detects HTTP traffic on TCP port 80.
*	SSH Connection Detection,	alert tcp any any -> any 22 (msg:"SSH Connection Detected"; sid:1000003; rev:1;) ,	Detects SSH connection attempts on port 22.
*	Telnet Connection Detection,	alert tcp any any -> any 23 (msg:"Telnet Connection Detected"; sid:1000004; rev:1;) ,	Detects Telnet traffic on port 23.
*	FTP Connection Detection,	alert tcp any any -> any 21 (msg:"FTP Connection Detected"; sid:1000005; rev:1;) ,	Detects FTP connection attempts on port 21.
*	DNS Query Detection	alert, udp any any -> any 53 (msg:"DNS Query Detected"; sid:1000006; rev:1;) ,	Detects DNS queries over UDP port 53.
